      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Use a `Team` object in the expression of a matchmaking rule to access the players that Game Center assigns to a team.",
          "refs": []
        }
      ],
      "listItems": []
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Properties",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "-`maxPlayers: The maximum number of players on the team. -`minPlayers: The minimum number of players on the team. -`name: The name for the team that's unique within the scope of its rule set.  -`players: An array of `player` objects representing the players that Game Center assigns to the team.",
